{"id":"n91667-1-7","stage":0,"title":"지각 · 迟到","scene":"校园与学习","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n91667-1-7-1","ko":"승규는 오늘 왜 학교에 지각을 한 거니?","zh":"承奎，你今天为什么上学迟到了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"승규는","meaning":"承奎","explanation":"승규：承奎；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"승규는","audio":"/audio/8cca37774e5e7081db86.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"학교에","meaning":"学校","explanation":"학교：学校；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"학교","audio":"/audio/f7b9c878ccca829ab6ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73276","senseId":"1","lemma":"학교","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"지각을","meaning":"迟到","explanation":"지각：迟到；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"지각","audio":"/audio/4415e2551a08952bcd87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91667","senseId":"1","lemma":"지각","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"한","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거니?","meaning":"表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"4","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"f7b9c878ccca829a","term":"학교","zh":"学校","audio":"/audio/f7b9c878ccca829ab6ab.mp3","entryId":"73276","definition":"按照一定的目标、教育课程、制度等，教师对学生进行教育的机构。","pronunciation":["학꾜"]},{"id":"4415e2551a08952b","term":"지각","zh":"迟到","audio":"/audio/4415e2551a08952bcd87.mp3","entryId":"91667","definition":"比规定时间晚上班或上学。","pronunciation":["지각"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/332a7058fe18752f69ba.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n91667-1-7-2","ko":"아침에 늦잠을 잤어요.","zh":"我早上睡过头了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아침에","meaning":"早上，早晨","explanation":"아침：早上，早晨；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"아침","audio":"/audio/2fdd736548d881c6da93.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27368","senseId":"1","lemma":"아침","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"늦잠을","meaning":"懒觉","explanation":"늦잠：懒觉；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"늦잠","audio":"/audio/4dc69297f0f60b6cd02e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"41393","senseId":"1","lemma":"늦잠","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잤어요.","meaning":"睡，睡觉","explanation":"자다：睡，睡觉；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"자다","audio":"/audio/023aa5fb341789792a99.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69511","senseId":"1","lemma":"자다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"2fdd736548d881c6","term":"아침","zh":"早上，早晨","audio":"/audio/2fdd736548d881c6da93.mp3","entryId":"27368","definition":"从天渐渐变亮到太阳出来，一天的事情开始的时间。","pronunciation":["아침"]},{"id":"4dc69297f0f60b6c","term":"늦잠","zh":"懒觉","audio":"/audio/4dc69297f0f60b6cd02e.mp3","entryId":"41393","definition":"早上睡到很晚的觉。","pronunciation":["늗짬"]},{"id":"023aa5fb34178979","term":"자다","zh":"睡，睡觉","audio":"/audio/023aa5fb341789792a99.mp3","entryId":"69511","definition":"闭眼睛，停止身体、精神活动，一时进入休息状态。","pronunciation":["자다"]}],"audio":"/audio/50f2ead7b59ecf6047af.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.858,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=91667","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":29,"sequenceScore":1.4101,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我早上睡过头了。","听说这次工资要降低了啊。","承奎，你今天为什么上学迟到了？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我早上睡过头了。","承奎，你今天为什么上学迟到了？","听说这次工资要降低了啊。"],"answer":0}]}
